window.products.push({"id":343003,"name":"Creative Converting Vintage Vixen 60th Birthday Centerpiece with Honeycomb Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vRLfuVaIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Like a fine wine, our Vintage Vixen collection celebrates the perfectly aged lady's 60th birthday. Double sided decorative centerpiece professes the guest of honor as \"perfectly aged - elegant and complex with a refined nuttiness\" and will make turning the big 6-O a big hit. Centerpiece has a tissue paper honeycomb base and measures 9\" x 9\" x 11.75\" tall when constructed. She's a classic with a velvety elegance yet with a burst of good-humored fun. This ensemble captures the spirit of a woman who has it all: grace, style and a great sense of humor. You can't rush perfection, but you can make her party look perfect with coordinating tableware and decor from Creative Converting. From invitations to balloons to tablecloths, this ensemble has everything to make the celebration a one-of-a-kind event!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vRLfuVaIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Converting","source_asin":"B00BEH93NS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343003","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BEH93NS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BEH93NS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
