window.products.push({"id":343101,"name":"U Water Cooler Bottle Rack (Silver, Four Bottle Rack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812tMvXc7wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The stylish & innovative \"U\" water cooler bottle racks are designed to effectively store your water cooler bottles in your home or office. . U Water Cooler Bottle Racks are attached to one another and create stability and strength through their unique structure. Allowing you to adapt the rack capacity according to the number of water cooler bottles you want to stack.   The U Water Cooler Bottle Racking system will hold both 3 & 5 gallon (11 & 18.9 litre) water cooler bottles. Dimensions: Assembled (free of bottles) : 13.2 * 14 * (H) 45.5 (inches) 335 x 355 x (H) 1,155 mm Stored (while not in use): 13.2 * 14 * (H) 12.6 (inches) 335 x 355 x (H) 320 mm Bottles are for illustration purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812tMvXc7wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Birando","source_asin":"B00N05RMGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N05RMGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N05RMGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":343102,"name":"Flan Mold, Stainless Steel Flan Pan Mold with Lid(87 oz) Compatible with Instant Pot 8 qt [6qt avail] Flanera Flan Maker Quesillera Molde Para Flan, F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xp9WsNBCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"ENOUGH CAPACITY & 3 LOCKS DESIGN: Pan Size : 8.3\" x 3.2\". Overall Size: 8.8\" x 3.7\". Capacity 87 Fluid Ounces. Each flanera mold has 3 latches, seal and waterproof. The most important thing is that the convenient handle allows you to easily transport the food to the party. The surface polishing allows you to long-term use, scratch-resistant and easy to clean. The best flan pans for baking is deeper than any other straight sided pan, enough to holds entire recipe. REMOVABLE SEALING LID: Flanera flan maker is very suitable for making popular and delicious food. The moldes para hacer flan have a sealed lid, which can keep the food fresh and achieve the effect of heat preservation. The heat is transferred through the body of the flan mold to make the food cook even and fast. The lid is equipped with a lifting handle, which is easy to extract after you finish cooking. Flan pan with a removable lid is convenient for cleaning and storing more food. SAFE & HEALTHY COOKING OPTIONS: Flan mold is made of heavy-duty food grade 304 stainless steel. Durable and does not rust and is dishwasher safe. You can put the flan pan in the oven to make delicious flans. Unlike other cheap materials, there will be no cheap chemicals leaching into your baked goods. Flan molds for baking is the most popular design in Mexico and Latin America MULTI-FUNCTION & APPLICATION: You will liked the size as it was easy to flip onto a platter. Molde para flan is safe to bake in the oven. You can put the flan mold pan inside another container with a little water to create a water bath / baño maria. Baking in an oven will give you best result and is the traditional way of making flan. Fits 6 and 8 quart Stovetop and instant pot and others. Want to experiment making a cheese flan as well as other flavors? Come and have a try! WORRY-FREE AFTER-SALES SERVICE: Our flanera flan maker is healthier and safer than aluminum and non-stick pans. You can use caramel flan pan as a lunch box to store food or anything you want to cook, which perfectly solves the problem of cooking large objects. We provide worry-free after-sales protection. If you are not satisfied with the received product, please contact us directly for refund or replacement. Buy this set, I am sure you will be pleased!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xp9WsNBCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LCPUD","source_asin":"B08F9JW81F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F9JW81F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F9JW81F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
