window.products.push({"id":343121,"name":"1/2 GALLON Sun Tea Suntea Drink Glass Jar HALF GALLON Solar NEW GLASS BOTTLES !","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AjB1JWA9L._AC_.jpg","description":"THAT`S RIGHT REAL GLASS WITH THE INDENTED HAND HOLDS ! LQQKS LIKE A MILK BOTTLE ? HURRAY! YOU`RE RIGHT THESE NEW MILK BOTTLES HAVE NEVER BEEN USED AND HAVE NO PAINTED LOGOS! COMES WITH A REUSABLE PLASTIC CAP AND MORE CAPS ARE AVAILABLE. RELIVE THE OLD DAYS IN NEW WAYS ! ONE THING IS FOR SURE THESE BOTTLES CAN LAST A LIFETIME AND BE HANDED DOWN TO THE NEXT GENERATION! THESE ARE SO MUCH MORE SANITARY THAN PLASTIC OR METAL! HALF GALLON I adore these, I order a few to use as vases around the house during the summer months when my flower garden is full of blooms, and they are just gorgeous when filled with flowers. Am going to get some more to give as vases for housewarming gifts! I sell my goat milk in these and think they take my customers back to a simpler time. Of course I take a deposit from each customer! Can't be losing my favorite bottles! I was looking to find clear, washable milk jugs and also stumbled upon these bottles. The sizes, tops, and durability are fantastic! I am ordering more. I also think that the milk stays fresher longer because it seems to be colder in the glass. Plus, it takes me back to my childhood and milk being delivered to the door! An attractive presentation as well. My sister and I have been making homemade cheese for about a year. When we started we searched high and low in the dairy section at our local super market for milk that was only pasturized, not Ultra-pasturized. We soon realized that we were extremely limited and cost was going to be a factor. So we decided to go straight to the source. We found a lovely family owned farm and started to buy our milk fresh from their wonderful Holsteins. The problem was that we wanted between six and ten gallons of milk at a time and all those mason jars were a pain in the neck. Thinking it would be easy to find \"Glass Milk Bottles\", I searched on the Internet and only by shear luck did I find them here. My order was filled quickly and arrived sooner than expected.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AjB1JWA9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STANPAC","source_asin":"B00KUW07JM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KUW07JM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KUW07JM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
