window.products.push({"id":343186,"name":"Placemats Set of 6 Cotton Linen Table Place Mat Retro Farm Gradient Brown Grey Beige Wooden Board Burlap Food Mat Waterproof Dinner Table Setting Tabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lPVlq5JcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Excellent Kitchen Helper And Home Furniture Decoration! * Parameter Information Of Placemat 1.Premium Material ----Our Table Placemats Are Made Of Linen And Cotton, Which Makes Place Mat Are Softer Than Pure Linen Food Mats And More Durable Than Pure Cotton Mats. 2.Feature ----Water-Repellent, Non-Slip, Stain Resistant, Wrinkle Free, East To Clean, East To Maintain, Easy To Store. 3.Perfect Size ----Each Panel Is 13X19 Inche(33X48 Cm). 4.Package Include ----Set Of 6 Placemats 5.Heat-Resistant----Effective Heat Resistance Of Approximately 167°F(75℃). 6.Easy Cleaning ----Simply Clean With Damp Cloth Then Store In A Dry Place 7.Machine Washable ----Gentle Circle In Low. No Bleach. 8.Mutli Function ----A Beautiful Table Tablecloth Of Small Table, Dress, Drawer, Cabinet. ---- Perfect For Home Kitchen, Living Room, Hall, Bathroom, Bedroom, Business Office, Restaurants, Cafes, Bar, Coffee Tables,Etc. ----Suitable For White, Dark, Brown, Farmhouse, Modern, Wooden, Glass, Marble,Round, Rectangle, Oval/ Dinner Table ( Even You Can Use It In The Drawer Of The Desks Table) ----Great Idea For Dinner, Party, Afternoon Tea, Togethering, BBQ, Wedding, Receptions, Fathers Day, Mothers Day, Valentines, Thanksgiving Giving, Christmas All Holiday Festival Occasions. ----Placemats For Dog, Cat, Pet Bowls 2.Please Note ----Manual Measurement, There May Be An Error Of 1-2 Inches. ----These Placemats Are Made Of Cotton And Linen Fabric, Please Do Not Put Them On The Wet Table. ----Due To The Influence Of Different Monitors And Other Factors, The Color Of The Picture May Be Slightly Different From The Actual Object.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lPVlq5JcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Falaniique","source_asin":"B095YWRN8B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095YWRN8B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095YWRN8B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":343187,"name":"Zulay Kitchen Powerful Milk Frother Handheld - Easy-to-Grip Hand Mixer Electric - Twister-Design Mini Mixer for Powder Drinks - Coffee Frother Handhel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d+6u--ZpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE FROTH EXPERT: You can now make barista-style coffee recipes at home with this milk frother. Powered by a 13,000 RPM motor and built with 25 spiral rings on the whisk, our coffee foam maker can whip up rich and velvety froth in seconds. Add that professional finish touch on warm or cold coffees, lattes, cappuccinos, matcha, or powdered drinks. COMFORTABLE FROTHING EXPERIENCE: We have designed this one-of-a-kind handheld frother with a large on/off button that gives you complete control when whisking up your favorite drink. The unique grip design and shape will make sure you enjoy frothing up some creamy goodness every time. LIFETIME COFFEE ACCESSORY: This coffee frother is built with premium stainless steel that will not rust and will last through all your frothing needs for years to come. It works on all types of milk, such as creamer, soy, almond, and other dairy items like butter or cream. Carry this matcha whisk anywhere you’d need that extra boost of energy. It is powered by 2 AA batteries (not included). EASY TO CLEAN AND STORE: Place the whisk under running water and briefly pulse the hand frother to get rid of any milk residue. The handle can be wiped with a damp cloth. This compact electric whisk can easily fit in a drawer or can be placed right next to your coffee accessories. HASSLE-FREE, ZULAY GUARANTEE: We love and take pride in our milk foamer and back it up with a lifetime guarantee. If there are any issues, just contact us, and we will make it right (even after the Amazon return window). Make every coffee a special treat with this frother!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d+6u--ZpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B0C2ZSGHRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343187","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2ZSGHRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2ZSGHRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
