window.products.push({"id":343225,"name":"JIKKIT USB Plug in Fairy Lights with Remote Control Timer, Twinkling Frequency Adjustable Copper Wire String Lights, 8 Modes 33Ft 100 LED USB String L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jtidsH5tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"USB Fairy Lights Plug In with Remote Control How to use the remote: Please take off the plastic on the remote battery before using it! Please aim the remote at the USB receiver to use! Please try to change batteries if the remote doesn't work! Timer Setting There is a timer key on the remote control, when you press the TIMER key, there will be a light on the USB port. Different colors of light mean different periods. Red Light: 4 hours on, 20 hours off Green Light: 6 hours on, 18 hours off Blue Light: 8 hours on, 16 hours off You need to reset the timer if you press the off button or shut off the power. The lights will auto turn on and off every day after you set the timer. One remote can control multiple string lights. DIY Your Home Decorations Adjust the fairy lights into any shape you want. The wires are thin but sturdy, you can use them to decorate floral centerpiece, DIY costume, or to highlight your personal event. Waterproof Copper Wire The wire parts of the string lights are fully sealed, making it submersible. It's ideal for both outdoor and indoor decoration. Convenient to Use The copper wire and led bulbs are low heat emission and safe to touch after many hours of usage. In addition, you can connect the USB port directly to a portable power bank or computer and use it wherever you like. We assurance you will love this USB Plug in Fairy Lights with Remote Control Timer. But if you’re not satisfied with this USB Plug in Fairy Lights with Remote Control Timer, please get in touch with us. We have a well trained customers sevice team, which could reply you in short time and give you help, aim to give a better shopping experience to our customers. Please rest assured to buy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jtidsH5tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JIKKIT","source_asin":"B08ZXPWJMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZXPWJMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZXPWJMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":343226,"name":"Elegear Cube Vacuum Storage Bag-4 Pack (2 Jumbo + 2 Medium) Extra Large Space Saver Bags,No Need Pump 5 Seconds Compress Airtight Vacuum Cubes Sealer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71twpPKz8pS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👔【80% More Space Saving】1 cube vacuum storage bag ≥ 4 flat compression storage bags, the large capacity vacuum cube space bags can store away your bulky items that allows you to save 80% more storage space. The jumbo storage bag (30X40X15in) can fit 6 pillows or 3 king-size quilts, the medium storage bags (20X28X12in) can fit 4 down coats or 8 sweaters or 30 T-shirts. You can easily organize and store your out-of-season clothes and bedding. 👚【 Innovative 3X Faster Valve 】 Elegear space-saving vacuum cube storage bags are equipped with the latest turbo valve to exhaust every ounce of air out and no air in, it is 3 times faster than ordinary valves. No clumsy hand pumps needed. Just press the bag with both hands or sitting on the bag to compress, you will squeeze the air out in 5 seconds. It's faster if you use a vacuum. Plus, no cap needed, no worry about missing caps. 🎒【 Upright Cube Compression 】 Use cube shape square bottom design, your items can be filled upright and vacuum down to a roughly box-ish shape. With our cube vacuum storage bags, you can place it vertically to save more space in wardrobes, closets, garages, basements, lofts. The compression won’t damage the goods you store inside, a perfect storage solution for bulk items like quilts, pillows, duvets, bedsheets, towels, blankets, stuffed animals, down jackets, etc. 👜【 Premium Double Zip Seal 】 Smart color-changeable zipper, identify the seal condition by zipper color. When the zipper turns grey, it means the vacuum cubes bag is well sealed. The double zipper ensures long-term compression condition. The sealed bags will stay vacuumed for up to 1 year! The smooth zipper comes with a stay-on clip, you can seal the bags by just one across. Also, the zipper has one lower side and one higher side, you can separate them easily to reuse. 👖【 High-Quality Protection 】 Made of high-quality PA＆PE material with high seam strength, high puncture resistance and better sealing performance, our cube vacuum storage bags are tear-resistant, anti-leak, waterproof, and odor resistant. So you can put it away anywhere you need with no worry. The vacuum cubes storage bags will be airtight once sealed, which will protect your clothes, pillows, comforters, and other items from dust and weird smell for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71twpPKz8pS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegear","source_asin":"B08VNBPJS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VNBPJS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VNBPJS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
