window.products.push({"id":343242,"name":"CoTa Global Flip Flop Refrigerator Nautical Ocean Magnets Set of 2 - Assorted Resin Beach Design, Fun and Cute Beach Magnets for Kitchen Fridge, Locke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Tma9DXKaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE FLIP FLOP NAUTICAL OCEAN MAGNET DECOR COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Add an extra touch of beach vibes to your day & display your collection of beach life novelty magnets! Perfect resin magnet decor can attach to any metallic surface and will make it look breezy & cool. Flip Flop Nautical Ocean Magnets are decorated with beach theme vibrant colorful decoration. Must-have home & office accessory for hanging beach vacation memories. THE COOL FRIDGE MAGNETS ARE FOR WHIMSICAL NOVELTIES LOVERS – Perfect home and office ornament for magnet collectors and beach life lovers who'd like to add funky decor magnets to their stationery to help them stay organized. Surprise your colleagues with entertaining unique decorative Flip flop magnets to hang pictures, memories, pictures and random notes. Ideal for parents who love leaving cute notes for their little ones & post grocery lists. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF CUTE REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Includes CoTa Global Assorted design Set of 2 Flip Flop Nautical Ocean Fridge Magnets. The magnets feature colorful flip flops adorned with beach inspired anchor & sailboat. The nautical ocean magnetic decor set features realistic details and are colored with vibrant colors making them the perfect accent for plain-colored refrigerators. Cute kitchen fridge magnets that measure 4\" long. HIGH-QUALITY FLIP FLOP NAUTICAL OCEAN MAGNETS – Fun magnets for refrigerator made of premium quality resin construction molded in unique shapes with strong magnet attached to the back of each 3D-shaped colorful flip flop figure. The flip flop figures are shaped in a unique way, resulting in the perfect decoration item for your office, locker, and refrigerator door. Make the magnets stand out and display the beautifully designed flip flops. IDEAL USE FOR THE FLIP FLOP REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Decorate your kitchen fridge door, dishwasher, locker, whiteboard, cabinet, and any metal surfaces that attract magnets with fun novelty magnets. Flip flop magnets make a cool display on the kitchen fridge and an amusing locker decor to help in posting notes, recipes, checklists, reminders, photos and drawings. Perfect set of functional multi-use magnets for the home or any office work-space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Tma9DXKaS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CoTa Global","source_asin":"B075VK7ZTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075VK7ZTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075VK7ZTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
