window.products.push({"id":343253,"name":"LLB Sheepskin Chair Cushion Non-Slip Back Square Genuine Fur Chair Cover Silky Natural Wool Seat Cushion Pad Soft Area Rugs Carpet for Home Office Res","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UAipjNX7L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"LUXURY QUALITY SHEEPSKIN CHAIR CUSHION:This luxurious sheepskin chair cushion will enhance the comfort and look of your chair. Measuring 18 x 18 inches, our cushion is flexible enough to match any feature seat, car seat, vanity chair, office seat, bedroom seat or sofa that needs extra comfort and more. BENEFITS OF GENUINE SHEEPSKIN:Real wool is warm in winter and cool in summer, it can naturally adapt to regulate the temperature, Moisture-wicking and perspiration-wicking properties of genuine wool is also unique in nature, it can absorb 30% of its weight in moisture without feeling wet, when encountered with air circulation, there is easy to evaporate into the air in time, real wool has excellent skin-friendly-even if you sit for a long time will feel very comfortable. The 18x18 inch fluffy sheepskin cushion is THE PERFECT DECORATION for your room - it can be used as a cushion on your favorite chair or sofa, in the girls bedroom, living room, study, dining room, dressing room, etc. It is also a great decoration for any room - so the sheepskin cushion is the perfect gift for friends and family - birthdays, Christmas, Thanksgiving and Children's Day. Whether it's for your family or friends, they'll love it! ANTI-SLIP DESIGN:our sheepskin chair cushion is not easy to fade, the back composite anti-slip silicone particles, versatile, good stability! THE DIFFERENCE BETWEEN GENUINE WOOL AND FAKE WOOL：When you touch real or fake wool, it feels completely different. Real wool has plenty of elasticity, feels smooth and warm to the touch, while fake wool has no elasticity, feels astringent to the touch and has a cold feel to the touch.Real wool products are quite warm and do not produce static electricity. Fake wool products, not as warm as real wool, sometimes static electricity, and sometimes you can hear the \"hissing\" sound. SHEEPSKIN RUG DAILY CARE：SPECIAL ATTENTION: Dry clean only！Sheepskin products can not be washed, washing will lead to shrinkage deformation! Simply shake out dirt and debris.And Regular vacuuming is ideal to remove dust and lint. If you spill something sticky or oily on sheepskin,quickly remove the excess and then spot clean the area with special wool liquid soap or alcohol and let dry naturally, out of direct sunlight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UAipjNX7L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LLB","source_asin":"B0BGPXKQHF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGPXKQHF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGPXKQHF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
