window.products.push({"id":343258,"name":"FHSGGP Travel Pillow Travel Pillow Cushion for The Back seat of a car Car Pillow for Kids A Sleeping Artifact Suitable for Long-Distance Travel of Adu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KS5S6nKWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: The travel pillow is made of imitation rabbit fur fabric,filled with enough PP cotton, which is very soft and comfortable. The fabric has constant temperature characteristics. It is warm in winter and cool in summer, not shedding, and does not fade. Car pillow: FHSGGP travel pillow is a brand new car sleep pillow. The perfect combination of U-shaped design and safety belt solves the safety problem of children and the elderly during long distance travel. Use it when your child is in the car. It will support any direction, maintain the correct sitting posture, and make your driving easier. The best gift for children: We took a long drive and the children fell asleep in the car. He rested his head on the seat belt and looked uncomfortable. Children usually fall asleep in the car with this travel pillow, and their heads will not fly around, so it will be safer and more comfortable. Travel pillow for kids: On the long journey, children's bodies will stagger due to sleep difficulties, and there may be potential safety hazards. The travel pillow can solve these problems very well, and when the child sleeps in the car, no matter the head is tilted in any direction, it will be well supported. FHSGGP Travel Pillow is a patented design to make your travel easier and more enjoyable. Travel necessities: It is suitable for adults and children to use during travel, can be used in cars, planes, trains, school buses, and is also a great pillow for camping and sleeping.The travel pillow is packed in vacuum compression. When you open the package, it will keep expanding. You can shake it and tap it gently to help it recover. It may take twelve hours to recover to the best state.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KS5S6nKWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FHSGGP","source_asin":"B09QJS9HH9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QJS9HH9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QJS9HH9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
