window.products.push({"id":343332,"name":"Tonature Custom Size Cordless Cellular Shades Light Filtering Honeycomb Roller Window Shades 1.5\" Cellular Blinds for Windows, Office, and Sliding Gla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uYTQtoGJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ORDER CONFIRMATION】You can choose the Color and Material Type first. Then click \"Customize Now\" on the upper right to find more size choices. Order the closest size and then we will send email within 24 hours to confirm window information,if we do not get any reply in 48 hours, we will make the size without any adjustment. If you are not sure about size and color, pls contact us before you order or just order one blind to test. 【EXCELLENT MATERIAL】 100% Polyester imported. Color is the same on both sides and the 1.5\" single cell construction produces a uniform look from the outside. Light Filtering, thermal insulation, soundproof, while also reducing the harmful effects of ultraviolet rays and providing ideal insulation for energy efficiency.Various colors are great choices for living room, bedroom, bathroom or any room. 【UPGRADED CORDLESS DESIGN】These are BOTTOM-UP ONLY. Smooth and quiet glide spring system provides a clean and tangle-free look and creates a safer environment for both children and pets. It will stay at whatever position you stop and can be easily raised or lowered with the touch of a finger. The bottom aluminum rail is weighted and rigid so it hangs flat and prevents from wind blowing. A rod for cordless blinds included in package. 【How to choose a correct size to fit? Example your window meas 23\" width by 72\" length.】INSIDE MOUNT: window width is blind width, window height is blind height. Blind Width=23\"; Blind Height=72\". OUTSIDE MOUNT: Plus at least 4\" is blind width, plus at least 4\" is blind height. Blind Width=23\"+4\"; Blind Height=72\"+4\".【Pls Note】Fabric width will be 0.16\" shorter than the size of the shade. 【Shipping and Service】Dispatch in 5 working days. 5-7 working days for transportation. Each custom size shades made to order can't be sold after a return. We appreciate your precise measures & careful orders, avoiding return without quality issues. Tonature offers a 1-year warranty on all our products, during which we will repair/replace them free of charge. Please feel free to email us by Amazon message if you have any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uYTQtoGJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tonature","source_asin":"B09NFQ3GJY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NFQ3GJY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NFQ3GJY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
