window.products.push({"id":343356,"name":"Large Cold Brew Coffee Iced Coffee Maker With Brush - 1.5L/50oz Non-slip Square Base Thick Borosilicate Glass Carafe with Removable Ultra Fine 304 Sta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WH9bP52ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our belief: \"life is a cup of coffee, you need to savor it carefully and slowly.\" Cold-brew ice makes coffee is less 70% acidic and smoother in taste than traditional brewing methods and lower caffeine, providing you with purer, healthier coffee concentrate. Why pick this cold brew coffee maker? 1. Superior stainless steel 304(18/10) stainless steel is the best material and not have any pollution for food. 18/10 stainless steel cap & filter, rust will never be a problem, discard the 18/8 steel. 2. Extra-thick Borosilicate glass The biggest problem with glass coffee maker carafe is that they are fragile. Extra-thick borosilicate glass will improve this situation. Food-grade and thermal shock resistant degree from -5°F to 300°F. 3. High capacity--1.5L 50oz If you want to drink more times iced coffee after one brewing, 1L cold brew coffee maker is too small for you, 1.5L will be fine. PS: In the transportation of the cold brew coffee maker, there was a 1% breakage rate. If you receive a damaged coffee maker, please send me an email and we will send you a new one on the second day. 4 Key Steps to Better Cold Brew at Home A larger grind — something closer to the coarseness of raw sugar — keeps the brew from getting bitter overnight. Use a higher ratio of coffee to water. 1 ounce of coffee per cup — making it easier to scale this recipe up or down. Steep for at least 12 hours, but not to steep for more than 15 hours or so. Use filtered water, if possible and Chill your cold brew with coffee ice cubes! What You Get: 1 * Womice Cold Brew Coffee Maker 1 * Brush and E-book--Gift","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WH9bP52ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOMICE","source_asin":"B07S7NWY58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S7NWY58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S7NWY58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
