window.products.push({"id":343362,"name":"Benifiture 2400CFM Air Mover with Timing Function, 3-Speed 1/2HP Portable Floor Blower Carpet Dryer, 48db Low Noise, with 16ft Cord, for Water Damage ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":158.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716SaT3hAKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"POWERFUL BUT NOT NOISY- With 1/2HP pure copper motor and 3 mighty soaring velocity speeds setting, this air mover will generate 2400CFM of airflow, which will dry your floor surface quickly. Please rest assured, the sound of such a powerful blower running will not exceed 45db. WITH SPECIAL TIMER FUNCTION- This centrifugal air mover has timer function (choice of 20, 40, 60, 80, 100, 120 minutes) that other machine do not have. Once the set time is up, the fan will automatically stop working, so you do not need to manually shut down the machine. In addition, the blowing time can be accurately set to reduce unnecessary waste of electric power resource. ALMOST SUP FOR YOUR BROAD- 3 placement positions (0°, 45°, 90°) enable various applications, such as moving water around easily, helping with the spills and flood, drying concrete, glue and paint in construction, cooling off the engine, circulating and cooling air indoors in the summer. TAKE IT ANYWHERE YOU WANT- With the optimal size, handle and weight of only 8 pounds, the floor blower dryer is easy to move around. Its sturdy design and stability makes it the best choice for your whether indoor or outdoor air circulation use. 16ft cord makes it a reality to place it anywhere you want. PRO WARRANTY- SGS safety certification and a 1-year warranty make your purchase worry-free. And our customer team will offer comprehensive support, including answering your questions, replacing your product or providing replacement parts. A UNIVERSAL USE- The blower can be greatly used anywhere you can think of ! ①HOME USE: garage, carpet, floor, house, basement, room, kitchen, attic, back patio, crawl spaces, cabinets, closets, cramped area. ②COMMERCIAL & INDUSTRIAL USE: hotel, shop, road, office, building, factory.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716SaT3hAKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Benifiture","source_asin":"B0B9NFLXHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9NFLXHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9NFLXHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
