window.products.push({"id":343437,"name":"fanquare Classic Blue and White Pocerlain Jar Vase, Lucky Lotus Pattern, Handmade, Jingdezhen, Height 9\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mueu-GlmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Ceramics -Vase Ceramics is a milestone in the history of mankind. It was discovered as early as a thousand years ago. It was originally a tool for putting things, and later became a work of art in the Song Dynasty (960-1279). During popular collection of ceramics, especially vases, more exquisiteness and beautiful .The traditional custom of China considers the Hua Ping or vase, which symbolizes safety or \"Ping Ping An An\" in Chinese. The vase is a kind of utensil. The vase has beautiful appearance and different shapes. Whether it is a celadon vase or a white porcelain vase or a colored porcelain vase, it is mostly used as a decorative display, and has very good collection value and ornamental value. Use & Maintenance 1. Regularly clean the stains on the outer wall of the vase and the water, sand on the inner wall. Avoid using hard objects such as wire scraps to avoid scratching the surface of the vase 2. Change the water regularly to prevent the long-term sewage from soaking the inner wall of the vase, and the water in the vase will breed many tiny creatures for a long time, which may corrode the vase 3. The vase is fragile, to avoid hard objects collide 4. Away from high temperatures to prevent the vase from cracking caused by excessive temperature Please feel free to contact us if you need personal customization, we support to do wholesale, OEM and ODM. So start decorating space. Create art spaces with fanquare vase. Click \"Add to Basket\" to get one today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mueu-GlmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fanquare","source_asin":"B093W9RK8V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093W9RK8V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093W9RK8V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
