window.products.push({"id":343470,"name":"NiHome 3-Tier Shoe Rack Multifunctional Organizer, Stackable Adjustable Lightweight Metal Space Saving, Free Standing for Closet Hallway Entryway Livi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UkCBaJjPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional Storage Organizer】This versatile 3-layer shoe shelf can accommodate up to 6 pairs of shoes for women, men and children, and is equipped with removable layers to suit your needs. It can also be used as a kitchen pantry rack, closet organizer, bookcase or multipurpose organizer to keep everything on display in an orderly manner. The rack is built with a sturdy PP frame and reinforced tubes with a large bearing capacity to stay stable and reliable. 【Detachable & Stackable】Combining functionality and versatility, this shoe rack has a simple design to suit any home decoration and bring a modern touch to your space. Every layer of the rack is independent and you can remove the middle shelf panel to make it suitable for tall boots, high heels, high tops and other large accessories. The special expandable design allows you to buy 2 or more sets and stack them vertically to build a larger shoe rack. 【Space Saving】A perfect design to reduce cluster and make everything neat and organized. This modern shoe shelf maximizes the storage space in the room, keeping the aisles clear and giving you a clean and comfortable environment. A great solution to keep your entryway, hallway, living room, wardrobe, closet, dormitory, terrace, patio, mudroom, cabinet, garden and garage away from messes. It’ll safely accommodate your ever-expanding shoe collection while saving your valuable floor space. 【Easy to Setup】The simple structure and light weight make the rack very convenient for you to assemble and disassemble. Installation requires only a few easy steps and no special tools are needed. Simply attach the shelf tubes to the side frame, then place the nonwoven fabric on tubes for each tier and snap tightly. Easy to clean with a dry or damp cloth and effortless to reposition and transport. Dimension: 16.5\" W x 8.3\" D x 12.6\" H. 【Stylish & Solid Construction】This modern shoe storage rack is made of rustproof bold steel tubes (3 tubes each tier), high-quality PP racks, and waterproof non-woven fabric tiers. Thickened pipes increase the load-bearing capacity for larger and heavy objects. Enhanced PP rack boards are plaid with leather patterns to ensure durability and stability. The fabric interlayer is wear-resistant, dustproof, breathable, eco-friendly and odder-proof.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UkCBaJjPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NiHome","source_asin":"B09HHJY7X5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HHJY7X5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HHJY7X5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
