window.products.push({"id":343504,"name":"Boyd Scottish Family Clan Crest Shot Glass 1.5 oz - Free Personalized Engraving","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611gEnLsj1S._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Clan Boyd Blazon: A dexter hand erect, pointing with the thumb and two fingers proper Clan Boyd Motto: Confido, \"I trust\" This specialty shot glass is engraved with the Clan Boyd Crest and the words \"Clan Boyd\" Below in Old English Font. The name Boyd comes from the first Boyd, Sir Robert Boyd, he was named such because his hair was blonde or in Gaelic, \"Buidhe.\" Clan comes from the Gaelic word \"clann\" which is translated to \"children,\" used to identify familial groups giving a common sense of generational connection. In Scotland the Clan system that is, Scottish Heraldry and Coats of Arms are regulated to this day by Lord Lyon who manages the Scottish Public Registers of Arms and Genealogies. *The engraving will not fade and the glass is dishwasher friendly. *We can design any family coat of arms, please contact us for your custom glasses! *Ask us about sets and large quantity discounts! (orders of 25 + units) FREE PERSONALIZED ENGRAVING: We offer free personalized lettering on ALL of our glassware! There is no limit on lettering but we ask that you please consider what will fit with the design. If you would like to personalize your order, just send a message with your purchase and please state the following: 1.) What you would like engraved with spelling, punctuation and capitalization as you would like them. 2.) Where you would like the glass engraved; 1.Above the design, 2.Below the design, or 3.Opposite the design. 3.) Font selection; Old English, Celtic or Elegant (please refer to picture above in listing for examples) Dimensions : Height : 2.5 \" Width : 1.5 \" Volume :2 oz. *Free Personalized Engraving v*We will replace any glass damaged during shipping promptly and free of charge","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611gEnLsj1S._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07DT8JSNC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DT8JSNC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DT8JSNC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
