window.products.push({"id":343548,"name":"ELPHECO Stainless Steel Kitchen Trash Can 15 Gallon Motion Sensor Trash Can Without Inner Bucket, Large Capacity Automatic Kitchen Waste Bin with Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EP2BVCMLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOTICE FOR CUSTOMERS - This product is a motion sensor trash can. Customers need to install 6 AA batteries(not included) to ensure the bin works properly. In the process of use, please do not hesitate to contact us if any problem occurs. DURABLE MATERIALS - The brushed stainless steel body is not only elegant, but also resistant to fingerprints. The sophisticated rectangular appearance also makes it suitable for a variety of occasions. It makes a shining impression from the outside. AUTOMATIC LID - This trash can is equipped with an infrared sensor and requires 6 AA batteries (not included). When you bring your trash or any part of your body near the sensor, the lid will respond quickly and open automatically within 0.3 seconds.The fully-developed smart sensing technology reduces unnecessary openings and extends battery life. NO INNER BUCKET DESIGN - ELPHECO 15 gallon large motion sensor trash can for kitchen doesn’t have any inner bucket. It maximizes capacity with the same dimensions. LARGE CAPACITY - 15.7''L×10.6''W×25.6''H, 15 Gallon. The huge capacity definitely meets your daily use. It can be a good helper for your kitchen and make your room clean and tidy. DISPLAY LIGHTS - There are 5 display lights. When you put the garbage or any part of the body in the sensing area, the bucket lid automatically opens and 5 blue display lights turn on. When leaving the sensing area, the blue light starts to read the seconds and the bucket lid closes in 5 seconds. CUSTOM FIT GARBAGE BAGS - Our code D trash bags are designed to fit perfectly in this trash can so they don't slip and are completely hidden. The extra thick plastic and double stitched construction prevents tears and breakage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EP2BVCMLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELPHECO","source_asin":"B0BGMSDPD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-343548","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGMSDPD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGMSDPD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
